{
  "type": "minecraft:multi_action",
  "title": {
    "text": "核心高级操作",
    "color": "#ff8800",
    "bold": true
  },
  "columns": 2,
  "pause": false,
  "body": [
    {
      "type": "minecraft:item",
      "item": "minecraft:writable_book",
      "show_tooltip": false,
      "show_decorations": false,
      "description": {
        "contents": [
          {
            "text": "需要核心本身参与的复杂操作，需要使用其他资源作为代价",
            "bold": true
          }
        ],
        "width": 170
      }
    }
  ],
  "actions": [
    {
      "label": {
        "text": "交换附魔",
        "color": "#E400FC",
        "bold": true
      },
      "action": {
        "type": "minecraft:run_command",
        "command": "trigger SupremeBoyTrigger set 11"
      },
      "width": 120,
      "tooltip": [
        {
          "text": "无需基座，请保证自身拥有超过600点经验值"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n左键点击，可消耗600点经验值将核心§b主副手物品§f的§d附魔§e调换"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "label": {
        "text": "附魔回归",
        "color": "#805100",
        "bold": true
      },
      "action": {
        "type": "minecraft:run_command",
        "command": "trigger SupremeBoyTrigger set 12"
      },
      "width": 120,
      "tooltip": [
        {
          "text": "无需基座，请保证自身拥有超过300点经验值，且核心主手拥有书"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n左键点击，可消耗300点经验值\n将核心§b副手物品§f的§d附魔§e回收到§b主手§f的§c普通书§f之中\n若§c仅持有书§f，则将制作§8空附魔§f的§e附魔书"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "label": {
        "text": "抗火处理",
        "color": "#D40000",
        "bold": true
      },
      "action": {
        "type": "minecraft:run_command",
        "command": "trigger SupremeBoyTrigger set 13"
      },
      "width": 120,
      "tooltip": [
        {
          "text": "无需基座，请保证自身拥有超过100点经验值"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n左键点击，可消耗100点经验值\n将核心§b主手物品§f设置为§e“该物品无法被火焰破坏”"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "label": {
        "text": "修补重置",
        "color": "#7D7D7D",
        "bold": true
      },
      "action": {
        "type": "minecraft:run_command",
        "command": "trigger SupremeBoyTrigger set 14"
      },
      "width": 120,
      "tooltip": [
        {
          "text": "\n需要基座，请在基座中填充以下材料："
        },
        {
          "text": "\n  §n┃§4§l§nX§f§l§n|O|§4§l§nX§f§l§n┃",
          "bold": true
        },
        {
          "text": "\n  §n┃O|E|O┃",
          "bold": true
        },
        {
          "text": "\n  ┃§4§lX§f§l|O|§4§lX§F§l┃",
          "bold": true
        },
        {
          "text": "\nO：恶魂之泪"
        },
        {
          "text": "\nE：附魔之瓶"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n左键点击，可消耗以上材料，并丢失§61000点§f经验\n将核心§b主手物品§f的§7修补所需经验等级§f设置为§e0"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "label": {
        "text": "无限耐久",
        "color": "#22238C",
        "bold": true
      },
      "action": {
        "type": "minecraft:run_command",
        "command": "trigger SupremeBoyTrigger set 15"
      },
      "width": 120,
      "tooltip": [
        {
          "text": "需要基座，请在基座中填充以下材料："
        },
        {
          "text": "\n  §n┃N|O|N┃",
          "bold": true
        },
        {
          "text": "\n  §n┃O|S|O┃",
          "bold": true
        },
        {
          "text": "\n  ┃N|O|N┃",
          "bold": true
        },
        {
          "text": "\nN：下界合金锭",
          "bold": false
        },
        {
          "text": "\nO：星源石"
        },
        {
          "text": "\nS：下界之星"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n左键点击，可消耗以上材料\n将核心§b主手物品§f设置为§e“该物品无法损坏”"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "label": {
        "text": "药水凝和",
        "color": "#00C3EB",
        "bold": true
      },
      "action": {
        "type": "minecraft:run_command",
        "command": "say 1"
      },
      "width": 120,
      "tooltip": [
        {
          "text": "无需基座，请保证自身拥有超过150点经验值，\n并且确保§b主副手§3药水§6拥有效果"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n左键点击，可消耗150点经验值\n将核心§b主副手§3药水§f的§6效果类型§e叠加§c(时间与强度不叠加)"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "exit_action": {
    "label": {
      "text": "返回上级",
      "bold": true
    },
    "action": {
      "type": "minecraft:show_dialog",
      "dialog": "supreme_boy_creations:main"
    }
  },
  "after_action": "none"
}